      <h1 id="horizontalpodautoscaler-autoscaling-v2" class="group scroll-mt-20">HorizontalPodAutoscaler [autoscaling/v2]<a href="#horizontalpodautoscaler-autoscaling-v2" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h1>
      <dl class="my-4 space-y-2">
      <dt class="font-semibold">Description</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>HorizontalPodAutoscaler is the configuration for a horizontal pod autoscaler, which automatically manages the replica count of any resource implementing the scale subresource based on the metrics specified.</p></dd>
      <dt class="font-semibold">Type</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><CodeBlock code={"`object`"} lang="plaintext" /></dd>
      </dl>
